# Node shapes: each tree's frontmatter, declared once.
# structure-check reads this file, and so does `sphere` when it writes a focus.md.
# Change a tree's frontmatter and its block here in the same commit (spec/nodes.md, "The shape check").
#
#   tree <name>
#   nodes folder <dir>          each subfolder of <dir> is a node (and each subfolder of <dir>/archived)
#   nodes file <dir> [deep]     each .md file in <dir> is a node; deep: at any depth
#   nodes file <dir> grouped    each .md file in <dir>, or one level down in a group folder
#   nodes either <dir>          each .md file in <dir> is a node, and so is each subfolder (its current file below)
#   current <file>              folder nodes: the current-state file, which carries the frontmatter;
#                               {name}.md is a file named like the folder (core/ai/personas/sage/sage.md)
#   history <file>              folder nodes: the history file
#   keys <key>...               keys every node has, even when empty, in this order; <key>? marks one it may leave out
#   optional <key>...           more keys a node may leave out (anywhere)
#   archived <key>...           keys a node has exactly when it's in <dir>/archived
#   values <key> <value>...     the only values <key> may take (its first word is checked)
#   format <key> <kind> [arg]   name (= the node's name), date (YYYY-MM-DD), int (0 or more),
#                               version (<major>.<minor>), list [item-pattern], list+ [item-pattern] (one or more)
#   scheme <scheme>             the naming scheme its node names follow (file name without .md, or folder name)
#   Names are unique across each tree, archive included; that one rule is checked for every tree.
#   skip <name>...              folders or files under <dir> that aren't nodes of this tree
#   index <file> <key>...       a generated index of the nodes, built by `sphere render` at every ground that
#                               changes one: a tree by `parent`, one line per node showing these keys
#
# structure-check reads frontmatter and folder listings only, never bodies, and skips <dir>/archived
# unless asked (--archive). Rules beyond these lines (idea, plan, focus) live in sphere_shapes.py.
#
#   kind history <entry>...     history files: append-only, merged by union, never reversed. An entry is a
#                               file name (anywhere), a folder/ (everything under it), or a path pattern (* ?).
#                               `sphere init` writes a merge=union line for each into .gitattributes
#                               (folder/ becomes folder/**), and structure-check expects them.
#   kind reference <prefix>...  reference files: changed only on the human's yes; an undo names them before it reverses them.
#                               A history file under a reference prefix is history.
#
#   naming <scheme> <pattern>   a naming scheme and the pattern its names match. Each scheme is described,
#                               with when it fits, in the node-names frame; a new one is added there first.

naming plain ^[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*$
naming namespace ^[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*(\.[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*)*$
naming prefix-number ^[a-z][a-z0-9]*(-[a-z0-9]+)*-[0-9]+$
naming number-name ^[a-z]+[0-9]+-[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*$
naming dated ^[0-9]{8}-[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*$

tree focus
nodes folder layers/focus
scheme number-name
current focus.md
history history.md
keys number name aka parent status intention holds through operating-mode collaboration-mode persona points-at opened
values status open closed

tree lens
nodes file core/protocol/lenses
scheme plain
keys lens version version_note derives_from status updated verified sharing until? frames
values status active drafting deprecated
values verified true false
values sharing public protected private
format until date

tree frame
nodes file core/protocol/frames deep
scheme plain
keys frame always? lens derives_from version version_note status updated sharing until? reads writes protocol
values always true
values status active drafting deprecated
values sharing public protected private
format until date
skip SKILL.md README.md

tree idea
nodes file layers/ideas
scheme dated
keys idea title captured topics stage refinements refined? related? outcome? change? horizon?
archived outcome
format idea name
format captured date
format topics list ^[a-z0-9-]+(\.[a-z0-9-]+)*$
format refinements int
format refined date
format related list ^([a-z]+:)?[a-z0-9-]+(\.[a-z0-9-]+)*$
values stage raw shaping ready
values outcome graduated parked
values change add refactor drop
values horizon now soon someday
skip contract.md

tree work
nodes folder layers/work
scheme namespace
current work.md
history progress.md
keys title kind? parent? state paused? waiting_on? ongoing? progress? summary plan? connects-to? updated
values kind area project task
values state planned active paused done dropped
values paused blocked waiting on
values ongoing true false
format progress pattern ^\d+/\d+$
format plan list
format connects-to list ^([a-z]+:)?[a-z0-9-]+(\.[a-z0-9-]+)*$
format updated date
index layers/work/index.md state progress summary
skip plans templates

tree plan
