tree projection
nodes either layers/projections
scheme plain
current {name}.md
keys projection title subtitle? namespace kind opens lifespan freshness sources writes home sharing until? template legacy
archived retired
format retired pattern ^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2} .+
format projection name
format sources list
format writes list
values kind live refreshed snapshot external
values opens static served markdown
values lifespan long-lived time-bound
values freshness on-open stale frozen
values sharing public protected private
format until date
values legacy true false
skip registry.md templates contract.md

tree knowledge
nodes folder layers/knowledge
scheme namespace
current topic.md
keys name title summary related? fresh_for? updated
format name name
format related list ^([a-z]+:)?[a-z0-9-]+(\.[a-z0-9-]+)*$
format fresh_for pattern ^(\d+[dwmy]|never)$
format updated date
skip history

